| **Error Handling** | No global error handler or 404/500 catch‑all | Unhandled routes → 404 default; any runtime error (e.g., DB crash) will surface stack traces to the client. |
| **Server Start** | `app.listen(3000)` | No graceful shutdown logic. |

> **Bottom line:** The app is intentionally minimal for a “legitimate task” context. As it stands it would be trivial to attach a malicious input or cause denial‑of‑service without proper safeguards. Below are concrete, security‑focused improvements you can make.

